  AgentHostChangesetService
    - registerStaticChangesets makes the two static changeset URIs subscribable with computing status
    - registerStaticChangesets is idempotent across repeated calls
    - restoreStaticChangeset publishes files in Ready and refreshes catalogue counts
    - restoreStaticChangeset catalogue counts only emitted unique files
    - restoreStaticChangeset works without a live session state (seeds the changeset for unopened sessions)
    session diff computation
      - git-driven path is preferred when a git service is provided and the working dir is a git work tree
      - session changeset falls back to _meta.git base branch when persisted diff base is absent
      - session changeset keeps persisted diff base ahead of _meta.git base branch
      - falls back to the edit-tracker aggregator when the git service returns undefined
    computeUncommittedChangeset
      - happy path: git returns diffs, state goes Ready with files, nothing persisted to the DB
      - no working directory: state goes Error with computeFailed
      - git returns undefined (not a git work tree): state goes Error with computeFailed
      - git throws: state goes Error with original message
    deferred refresh (working directory unknown)
      - refreshSessionChangeset / refreshBranchChangeset defer until the working directory is known, then drain the subscribed changesets
      - computeUncommittedChangeset defers until the working directory is known, then drains
      - a changeset unsubscribed before materialization is naturally skipped on drain
      - onSessionDisposed clears every pending refresh for the session
    restorePersistedStaticChangesets
      - parsePersistedStaticChangesets parses without mutating state
      - applyPersistedStaticChangesets seeds parsed diffs
      - new sessionRaw beats legacyRaw when both are present
      - legacyRaw still restores session state when sessionRaw is absent
      - malformed JSON logs and returns undefined for that slot
      - seedIfEmpty honoured: live state with files is not overwritten
      - with live session state, restored diffs publish ready + catalogue counts
    idle changeset LRU eviction
      - idle changeset states are evicted over the soft limit
      - evictability probe protects subscribed changesets
      - LRU eviction is silent and does not dispatch ChangesetCleared
      - trimming reconsiders entries after they become evictable
    per-turn live streaming
      - onTurnComplete schedules a per-turn recompute when someone is subscribed
      - onTurnComplete does NOT schedule a per-turn recompute when nobody is subscribed
      - onTurnComplete schedules an uncommitted recompute when someone is subscribed
      - onTurnComplete does NOT schedule an uncommitted recompute when nobody is subscribed
      - onToolCallEditsApplied fires the per-turn debounce only when subscribers exist; cancelled by onTurnComplete
      - per-turn URI streams a ChangesetContentChanged snapshot as the same turn is recomputed
    computeCompareTurnsChangeset
      - publishes diffs as Ready when both checkpoints resolve and git returns diffs
      - transitions to Error when either checkpoint is missing
      - returns empty Ready snapshot when both checkpoints point at the same ref
      - transitions to Error when the git diff returns undefined (git failure, not empty)

